  "summary": "Malicious code in shaon-video-downloader (npm)",
  "details": "The package's entire main module (src/index.js) is a single obfuscated blob: a custom XOR decoder that decodes and eval()s a payload whenever the module is required. No readable implementation is shipped. The bundled README documents usage of a differently-named package (shaon-videos-downloader), indicating the code is a repackaged/impersonating build. The decoded payload's behaviour is not visible in the shipped source; the package should not be installed.",
